siren: Starting calibration tests\:
siren: Pick up any metal with your magnets.
[signal arg="calibrate_magnet"]
[end_timeline]
label overpowered (overpowered)
siren: Too big! Too big! Lower it!
[end_timeline]
label lower (lower)
siren: A large burst happens sometimes. Now see if you can climb this wall.
[signal arg="siren_wall"]
[end_timeline]
label climb_wall (climb_wall)
siren: Try increasing your output until you can carry your own weight.
[end_timeline]